# Replace @OWNER with the maintainer handle or team when the repository is published.
# Review owners, enforced by the repository ruleset ("Require review from Code Owners").
# The last matching pattern wins. The explicit entries below name what must never change without the owner,
# even if the catch-all above is later narrowed.
*                          @OWNER

# CI, release and supply-chain configuration
/.github/                  @OWNER
/.github/workflows/        @OWNER
/Package.resolved          @OWNER
/Scripts/analyzers.lock    @OWNER

# What the signed app may do
/Resources/*.entitlements  @OWNER
